name=Tien's Generator Manager
id=TienGeneratorManager
description=Wire your generators: a top-down map of each generator's reach where you connect or disconnect squares. A device only gets power from a generator connected to it; disconnected squares lose power like in a blackout (lights, stoves, TVs, washers go dark, fridges warm up) and come back when connected again. Fuel is only used for what each generator really powers. Replaces Nick's Generator Manager.
